Adds the core option VDP1 Frame Change. 'VBlank Start' (default) keeps upstream's timing: a frame
change asked for before the VBlank is taken at VBlank-IN and one asked for during it at VBlank-OUT.
'VBlank End' takes every change at VBlank-OUT, as the hardware and Beetle do, which some games
need: The Legend of Oasis waits for the draw-end flag (CEF) to clear and set again around the
change and otherwise stays on a black screen. Doom needs the default (it plots and waits for CEF
between the two), so this is per game rather than the default.

